<p class="warn">Post it from your own account and keep the SyaCo disclosure in the text.${row.platform === 'devto' ? ' dev.to has no comment API, so paste it as a normal comment on the article.' : ''}</p>
<form method="POST" action="/webhook/backlink-mark-posted">
